    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d594">

                <pb facs="0717" n="615" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg615"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.811/284: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Reinsch</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-01-21T20:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 21,
                                1918, 8 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received
                            January 21, 4 p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your January 16, 7 p.m. Have spoken to His Excellency, Hsiung, and he has
                    authorized Chinese Minister by cable.</p>
                <pb facs="0718" n="616" xml:id="pg616"/>
                <p>As the advance is provided for in the main contract,<anchor n="43"
                        xml:id="d594-f1"/> it is not clear what further negotiations necessary
                    except arranging details of the advance.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
